suma can fetch tweets from Twitter. In addition, fusuma have an api endpoint. If you specify a `keyword` and `authentication keys`, fetching from twitter will be enabled. Since comments can be sent to fusuma itself, you can use in the private case. Also, this mode can run with Presenter Mode.","blocks":null,"service_name":"hiroppy.github.io","service_icon":"https://hiroppy.github.io/fusuma/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://hiroppy.github.io/fusuma/docs/modes/live","original_url":"https://hiroppy.github.io/fusuma/docs/modes/live"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WicS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a48c3ce0-2c70-412f-82dd-0f2d0013fd07","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"パット見の違い\n\n```MDX vs Vue component```\n```slidev\n---\nスライドショー中に編集(ブラウザでMonacoEditorを開ける)\nワイプの挿入\nインラインスタイル(そのスライドのみ適用させるスタイルの埋め込み)\nKaTeX\nMermaid\nアホほどConfigできる(Vue, Vite, WindiCSS, Monaco, KaTeX, Mermaind)\nNetlifyとVerceへのデプロイように設定ファイルがおいてある```\n```fusuma\n---\nスライドへの書き込み\nMathJax\nGithubPagesへのデプロイが簡単\nパフォーマンスとSEO対策```\n","ts":"1621870131.105900","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621870283.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eJoa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fb36897-2d0d-4b67-805d-9494168b4093","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"それ系だと fusuma だな。","ts":"1621869548.101400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lhGm"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023FGF5MSL","text":"\u003c@U023FGF5MSL\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621868784.100400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4ed8914a-139e-465a-b17f-2ceebaf6dae1","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"Slidevの辛